  "title": "Yeasty Fluffy Thai Shrimp Tom Yum",
  "description": "A Buddhist-temple-friendly, monsoon-inspired Thai dish featuring shrimp in a yeasty and fluffy Tom Yum soup, made with fish sauce and dashi extract.",
